    timeline: string;
    resources: string[];
    dependencies: string[];
  };
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Assesses a first-time engineering manager's ability to create structured onboarding processes, enforce API contract discipline, and balance delivery speed with quality standards in distributed team environments.

## Key Concepts
- Mentorship-driven onboarding pipelines
- API contract versioning and governance
- Automated CI contract validation
- Milestone-based skill progression

